          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চরিত্র (chôritrô) is a tatsama, Sanskrit caritra, \"going\", then \"behaviour, deeds\" and \"nature, disposition\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
